      {
        "id": "model-centered-trace",
        "moduleId": "parameterless-layer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "模型补充：把减均值算一遍",
        "markdown": "逐个元素核对这一步：输入 $(1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5)/5 = 3$，每个元素减去 3 后得到 $[-2, -1, 0, 1, 2]$，输出形状仍是 $(5,)$。中心化不改变形状，只是把整个张量平移，使新张量的均值为 0。\n\n正因为浮点求和无法精确表示，检查“均值是否为 0”时通常会得到接近 0 的小量，例如 $7.45 \\times 10^{-9}$。这是存储精度的性质，不是层实现错误；判断时用容差比较，而不是要求严格等于 0。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-centered-layer",
            "tb-centered-check"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-parameter-creation",
        "moduleId": "parameterized-layer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：带参数的层与参数创建函数",
        "markdown": "带参数的层需要一组可以通过训练调整的参数。教材强调应使用内置函数创建参数，因为这些函数提供基本的管理功能：访问、初始化、共享、保存和加载模型参数。这样做的好处之一是不必为每个自定义层编写自定义的序列化程序。\n\n教材随后实现自定义版本的全连接层：它需要权重和偏置项两个参数，输入参数 `in_units` 和 `units` 分别表示输入数和输出数，并在前向中使用修正线性单元（ReLU）作为激活函数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000040"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "深度学习计算",
                "自定义层"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8269,
              "lineEnd": 8449,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "197fb94583be8f4792a6db4d0032c03f4c22757d28c57b78f25cd4ab8ce7d4f3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mylinear-code",
        "moduleId": "parameterized-layer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：MyLinear 实现",
        "markdown": "```python\nclass MyLinear(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_units, units):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.weight = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(in_units, units))\n        self.bias = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(units,))\n\n    def forward(self, X):\n        linear = torch.matmul(X, self.weight.data) + self.bias.data\n        return F.relu(linear)\n```\n\n权重形状为 `(in_units, units)`，偏置形状为 `(units,)`；前向先做矩阵乘法并加偏置，再经过 ReLU。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
